     "`aws ec2 describe-instances --query 'Reservations[].Instances[].[InstanceId,IamInstanceProfile.Arn]'` — every instance that calls AWS has an instance profile.",
     "CI uses OIDC (e.g. GitHub Actions `aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials` with `role-to-assume`), not stored keys."
